  [Original Query ]: What is the taxability of sick pay?
  [Step-Back (Law)]: The taxability of sick pay generally hinges on the concept of **gross income** as it replaces lost wages. It is typically taxable unless the recipient paid the premiums for the sick pay plan with **after-tax dollars**, in which case the benefits are usually excluded.
